1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:03,800
If this disguise is what stands
in the way of our happiness...

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,380
then please, do not embrace me yet.

3
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:10,340
I understand.

4
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:11,800
But hurry,

5
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,890
and let me see you
dressed as a woman.

6
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,310
- Minato.
- Yes!

7
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:24,820
Try speaking from the heart next time.

8
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,440
Yes!

9
00:00:27,070 --> 00:00:29,400
Alright! Let's do this!

10
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:54,220
(8 days until the performance)

11
00:00:54,850 --> 00:00:56,720
Before the opening night,
there's a place I want to go.

12
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:58,100
Huh?

13
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,650
Well, there's only one place it could be.

14
00:01:02,940 --> 00:01:04,150
Where...?

15
00:01:04,690 --> 00:01:06,570
To see your mother.

16
00:01:10,650 --> 00:01:12,410
I want to properly convey

17
00:01:12,410 --> 00:01:13,780
my resolve to her.

18
00:01:14,530 --> 00:01:16,280
Senpai...
